.TH batten-verdict 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-verdict \- Fold a run\*(Aqs findings and blind spots into this tool\*(Aqs exit code
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten verdict\fR [\fB\-\-findings\fR] [\fB\-\-unjudgeable\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fold a run\*(Aqs findings and blind spots into this tool\*(Aqs exit code
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-findings\fR
How many blocking findings the run produced
.TP
\fB\-\-unjudgeable\fR
How many subjects the run could not read
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
